<div class="page-title"><div><em>ADMIN RESOURCES</em><h1>Platform tutorial</h1><p>A quick guide to managing NorthWest banking operations.</p></div></div><section class="tutorial-hero"><div><small>GETTING STARTED</small><h2>Welcome to the NorthWest admin portal</h2><p>Learn the core workflows for customer accounts, transactions, transfers and system security.</p><button class="btn" data-modal="guide-overview">▷ Watch overview</button></div><i>▷</i></section><div class="tutorial-grid"><?php $items=array('dashboard'=>array('Dashboard & reports','Understand real-time operational metrics and downloadable reports.'),'customers'=>array('Customer management','Create accounts, update profiles, balances and access status.'),'transactions'=>array('Transaction operations','Review, approve or decline pending deposits and transfers.'),'security'=>array('Security & settings','Configure fees, limits, currencies and administrative access.'));$n=1;foreach($items as $key=>$item):?><article class="panel"><small>0<?=$n++?></small><h3><?=$item[0]?></h3><p><?=$item[1]?></p><button class="guide-open" data-guide="<?=$key?>">Open guide ›</button></article><?php endforeach?></div>
<dialog id="guide-overview"><div class="dialog-head"><h2>Getting started</h2><button data-close>×</button></div><div class="guide-body"><p><b>The NorthWest admin portal</b> gives you a single, secure view over customer accounts, transactions, cards, loans and support. Here is your quick-start checklist:</p><ol class="guide-steps"><li><b>Dashboard</b> — review real-time metrics: customers, deposits, today's transactions and pending reviews.</li><li><b>Customers</b> — create accounts, review profiles, manage status and balances, and verify KYC.</li><li><b>Transactions</b> — approve or decline pending transfers; view the 7-day volume chart.</li><li><b>Cards & loans</b> — issue cards and loans, and monitor activity from the customer detail page.</li><li><b>Support tickets</b> — reply to and resolve customer requests.</li><li><b>System settings</b> — configure fees, limits, SEO, announcements, registration and exchange rates.</li><li><b>Audit log</b> — every action is recorded for accountability.</li></ol><p>Use the guided panels below for step-by-step help on each area.</p></div></dialog>
<dialog id="guide-dashboard"><div class="dialog-head"><h2>Dashboard &amp; reports</h2><button data-close>×</button></div><div class="guide-body"><p>The dashboard shows <b>total customers</b>, <b>total deposits</b>, <b>transactions today</b> and <b>pending reviews</b>. The 7-day chart and account distribution give a quick pulse on activity.</p><ul><li>Use <b>Add customer</b> to onboard a new account.</li><li>Review the <b>Recent customers</b> list for newly registered or created accounts.</li></ul></div></dialog>
<dialog id="guide-customers"><div class="dialog-head"><h2>Customer management</h2><button data-close>×</button></div><div class="guide-body"><p>Open a customer to manage their account.</p><ul><li><b>Status</b> — set Active, Pending, Suspended or Closed.</li><li><b>Balance adjustment</b> — credit or debit an account with a reference and note.</li><li><b>KYC verification</b> — set a customer's identity status to Pending, Verified or Rejected.</li></ul><p>Changes are audited automatically.</p></div></dialog>
<dialog id="guide-transactions"><div class="dialog-head"><h2>Transaction operations</h2><button data-close>×</button></div><div class="guide-body"><p>Use the Transactions, Transfers and Deposits views to review activity and set status.</p><ul><li>Pending deposits and transfers appear for review.</li><li>Set a transaction to <b>Completed</b>, <b>Failed</b> or <b>Cancelled</b>.</li><li>Every change is tracked in the audit log.</li></ul></div></dialog>
<dialog id="guide-security"><div class="dialog-head"><h2>Security &amp; settings</h2><button data-close>×</button></div><div class="guide-body"><p>The System settings page controls platform-wide behaviour.</p><ul><li><b>General</b> — institution name, support email, currency, transfer limit, session timeout, and public registration toggle.</li><li><b>SEO &amp; announcements</b> — site name, title, description, keywords and the scrolling announcement bar text.</li><li><b>Admin users</b> — create and list administrators.</li></ul><p>Keep secrets in the <code>.env</code> file and never commit them.</p></div></dialog>
<script>(function(){var guides={overview:document.getElementById('guide-overview'),dashboard:document.getElementById('guide-dashboard'),customers:document.getElementById('guide-customers'),transactions:document.getElementById('guide-transactions'),security:document.getElementById('guide-security')};document.querySelectorAll('.guide-open').forEach(function(b){b.addEventListener('click',function(){var d=guides[b.getAttribute('data-guide')];if(d)d.showModal();});});})();</script>
